  same area areab areac temp dtemp type subs is ibe ibc bf nf
  same ne br nr ikr nc rb irb rbm re rc cje tf
  same xtf vtf itf ptf cjc xcjc tr xtb eg xti fc kf
  same af iss ns rco vo gamma qco tlev tlevc tbf1 tbf2 tbr1
