# Names ngspice's model has and the module VACASK writes has not, which it
# refuses ("Parameter ... not found"), so they are not written. Where nothing
# changes they are warnings: bsim4v8.va takes rgeomod on the instance only
# (instance_rgeomod, :137, 0 by default); vbic_1p3.va and psp103v4 have no
# safe-operating-area check; the PSP 103.6 names psp103v4 (103.4) lacks, at
# the value that changes nothing in ngspice's module (docs/verification.md 3.5).
noparam bsim4 rgeomod=0 warning : sp_bsim4v8 takes rgeomod on the instance only (instance_rgeomod), 0 by default; at 0 it changes nothing
noparam bsim4 rgeomod error : sp_bsim4v8 takes rgeomod on the instance only (instance_rgeomod) and refuses it on a card; the devices are simulated at 0
noparam vbic vbe_max warning : VACASK's VBIC (vbic_1p3.va) has no safe-operating-area check; vbe_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam vbic vbc_max warning : VACASK's VBIC (vbic_1p3.va) has no safe-operating-area check; vbc_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam vbic vce_max warning : VACASK's VBIC (vbic_1p3.va) has no safe-operating-area check; vce_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam vbic vsub_max warning : VACASK's VBIC (vbic_1p3.va) has no safe-operating-area check; vsub_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 swsoa warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; swsoa changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 vgs_max warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; vgs_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 vgd_max warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; vgd_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 vgb_max warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; vgb_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 vds_max warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; vds_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 vsb_max warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; vsb_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 vdb_max warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4) has no safe-operating-area check; vdb_max changes no current there, and the check it asks for is not made
noparam psp103 st2vfbo=0 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 0 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 st2vfbo error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
noparam psp103 ctgo=0 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 0 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 ctgo error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
noparam psp103 ctbo=0 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 0 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 ctbo error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
noparam psp103 stcto=1 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 1 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 stcto error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
noparam psp103 stthecso=0 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 0 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 stthecso error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
noparam psp103 nsubedgelexp=1 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 1 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 nsubedgelexp error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
noparam psp103 thecso=2 warning : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter; at 2 it changes nothing
noparam psp103 thecso error : VACASK's PSP103 (psp103v4, PSP 103.4) has no such parameter and refuses it on a card; the device is simulated without its effect
computes resistor narrow short : R = RSH (L - 2 SHORT) / (W - 2 NARROW)
no pattern : VACASK has no pattern sources; a bit pattern is a PWL
no fft : VACASK has no FFT statement; a spectrum is post-processing of the transient result
no optimize : VACASK has no optimizer statement
no model mos6 : VACASK has no built-in MOS6; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model mos9 : VACASK has no built-in MOS9; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model bsim1 : VACASK has no built-in BSIM1; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model bsim2 : VACASK has no built-in BSIM2; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model b3soifd : VACASK has no built-in B3SOIFD; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model b3soidd : VACASK has no built-in B3SOIDD; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model b3soipd : VACASK has no built-in B3SOIPD; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no model mesa : VACASK has no built-in MESA MESFET; it loads compiled Verilog-A (OSDI), and SPRack knows no module for it
no script : VACASK's control block is where its analyses live (written around them); a script's other commands are its own simctl lines, not another simulator's
no csparam : only an ngspice control script reads a .csparam vector
no native : the statement is another dialect's own, which no kind holds; only that dialect writes it
